<section class="section" id="getting-started" aria-labelledby="start-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="start-title">البدء</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">أرسل رمزك كرمز Bearer. الرموز للقراءة فقط تستطيع استدعاء كل طلبات GET.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card stack-sm">
      <h3>المصادقة</h3>
      <pre class="code"><code id="curl-example">curl -H "Authorization: Bearer vv_…" http://vv.test/api/v1/monitors</code></pre>
      <div class="cluster">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-copy="#curl-example"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#copy"></use></svg><span>نسخ</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="help">هل سجّلت الدخول؟ تعمل نقاط النهاية نفسها بجلستك في هذا المتصفح، فيمكنك فتح روابط GET مباشرة.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card stack-sm">
      <h3>الاصطلاحات</h3>
      <dl class="dl">
        <div class="dl-row"><dt>العنوان الأساسي</dt><dd class="break mono">http://vv.test/api/v1</dd></div>
        <div class="dl-row"><dt>القوائم</dt><dd><code>?limit=&amp;cursor=</code> → <code>next_cursor</code></dd></div>
        <div class="dl-row"><dt>التخزين المؤقت</dt><dd>ترسل طلبات GET ترويسة <code>ETag</code></dd></div>
        <div class="dl-row"><dt>الأوقات</dt><dd>UTC, <code>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</code></dd></div>
        <div class="dl-row"><dt>الأسرار</dt><dd>تظهر كـ <code>••••••</code>؛ أعدها كما هي للإبقاء على القيمة</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <details class="disclosure card">
    <summary>الأخطاء <span class="disclosure-sub">شكل واحد لكل نقطة نهاية</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
    <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
      <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;error&#34;: {
    &#34;code&#34;: &#34;validation_failed&#34;,
    &#34;message&#34;: &#34;Enter a full URL, including https://, like https://example.com.&#34;,
    &#34;fields&#34;: {&#34;target&#34;: &#34;Enter a full URL, including https://, like https://example.com.&#34;}
  }
}</code></pre>
      <p class="help">الرموز: <code>bad_request</code> 400, <code>unauthorized</code> 401, <code>forbidden</code> 403, <code>not_found</code> 404, <code>conflict</code> 409, <code>validation_failed</code> 422, <code>delivery_failed</code> 502.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
<section class="section" id="monitors" aria-labelledby="monitors-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="monitors-title">Monitors</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-monitors">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/monitors</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">List monitors with their current status. status is what status pages show (maintenance during a window); maintenance says whether a window covers the monitor now; raw_status (up, down, pending or null), raw_status_since (RFC 3339) and raw_message are the real check result, which keeps coming in during maintenance. raw_* are null for paused monitors.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">المعاملات, أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <dl class="dl">
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>status</code></dt><dd>up | down | pending | maintenance | paused | unknown</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>type</code></dt><dd>monitor type, e.g. http</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>tag</code></dt><dd>tag name</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>q</code></dt><dd>search name, target and description</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>limit</code></dt><dd>page size (1–500, default 50)</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>cursor</code></dt><dd>next_cursor from the previous page</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;data&#34;: [ …monitor… ], &#34;next_cursor&#34;: &#34;42&#34;}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-monitors">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/monitors</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Create a monitor. Same validation as the monitor form; unknown tag names are created. check_from_agent_id (an agent id, null = this server) lets one remote agent check it instead of this server.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;,
  &#34;monitor_type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;,
  &#34;target&#34;: &#34;https://example.com&#34;,
  &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 60,
  &#34;retries&#34;: 1,
  &#34;tags&#34;: [&#34;production&#34;, {&#34;name&#34;: &#34;env&#34;, &#34;value&#34;: &#34;prod&#34;}],
  &#34;notifications&#34;: [1, {&#34;channel_id&#34;: 3, &#34;escalation&#34;: true}],
  &#34;escalation_minutes&#34;: 15
}</code></pre>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;id&#34;: 7,
  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;,
  &#34;description&#34;: &#34;&#34;,
  &#34;monitor_type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;,
  &#34;target&#34;: &#34;https://example.com&#34;,
  &#34;parent_id&#34;: null,
  &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 60,
  &#34;retry_interval_seconds&#34;: null,
  &#34;timeout_seconds&#34;: 10,
  &#34;retries&#34;: 1,
  &#34;active&#34;: true,
  &#34;upside_down&#34;: false,
  &#34;http_method&#34;: &#34;GET&#34;,
  &#34;accepted_status_codes&#34;: &#34;200-399&#34;,
  &#34;max_redirects&#34;: 10,
  &#34;ignore_tls&#34;: false,
  &#34;expiry_notify&#34;: true,
  &#34;expiry_days&#34;: 14,
  &#34;status&#34;: &#34;up&#34;,
  &#34;maintenance&#34;: false,
  &#34;raw_status&#34;: &#34;up&#34;,
  &#34;raw_status_since&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;,
  &#34;raw_message&#34;: &#34;200 OK&#34;,
  &#34;tags&#34;: [{&#34;id&#34;: 2, &#34;name&#34;: &#34;production&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;green&#34;, &#34;value&#34;: &#34;&#34;}],
  &#34;notifications&#34;: [{&#34;channel_id&#34;: 1, &#34;escalation&#34;: false}],
  &#34;created_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;,
  &#34;updated_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;
}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-monitors-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/monitors/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Get one monitor with status, maintenance and the real result (raw_status, raw_status_since, raw_message) as in the list. Passwords are masked; push tokens are shown to editors only.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;id&#34;: 7,
  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;,
  &#34;description&#34;: &#34;&#34;,
  &#34;monitor_type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;,
  &#34;target&#34;: &#34;https://example.com&#34;,
  &#34;parent_id&#34;: null,
  &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 60,
  &#34;retry_interval_seconds&#34;: null,
  &#34;timeout_seconds&#34;: 10,
  &#34;retries&#34;: 1,
  &#34;active&#34;: true,
  &#34;upside_down&#34;: false,
  &#34;http_method&#34;: &#34;GET&#34;,
  &#34;accepted_status_codes&#34;: &#34;200-399&#34;,
  &#34;max_redirects&#34;: 10,
  &#34;ignore_tls&#34;: false,
  &#34;expiry_notify&#34;: true,
  &#34;expiry_days&#34;: 14,
  &#34;status&#34;: &#34;up&#34;,
  &#34;maintenance&#34;: false,
  &#34;raw_status&#34;: &#34;up&#34;,
  &#34;raw_status_since&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;,
  &#34;raw_message&#34;: &#34;200 OK&#34;,
  &#34;tags&#34;: [{&#34;id&#34;: 2, &#34;name&#34;: &#34;production&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;green&#34;, &#34;value&#34;: &#34;&#34;}],
  &#34;notifications&#34;: [{&#34;channel_id&#34;: 1, &#34;escalation&#34;: false}],
  &#34;created_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;,
  &#34;updated_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;
}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="put--api-v1-monitors-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">PUT</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/monitors/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Replace a monitor: fields you leave out go back to their defaults (tags and notifications are kept unless sent).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;,
  &#34;monitor_type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;,
  &#34;target&#34;: &#34;https://example.com&#34;,
  &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 60,
  &#34;retries&#34;: 1,
  &#34;tags&#34;: [&#34;production&#34;, {&#34;name&#34;: &#34;env&#34;, &#34;value&#34;: &#34;prod&#34;}],
  &#34;notifications&#34;: [1, {&#34;channel_id&#34;: 3, &#34;escalation&#34;: true}],
  &#34;escalation_minutes&#34;: 15
}</code></pre>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;id&#34;: 7,
  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;,
  &#34;description&#34;: &#34;&#34;,
  &#34;monitor_type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;,
  &#34;target&#34;: &#34;https://example.com&#34;,
  &#34;parent_id&#34;: null,
  &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 60,
  &#34;retry_interval_seconds&#34;: null,
  &#34;timeout_seconds&#34;: 10,
  &#34;retries&#34;: 1,
  &#34;active&#34;: true,
  &#34;upside_down&#34;: false,
  &#34;http_method&#34;: &#34;GET&#34;,
