  &#34;notifications&#34;: [{&#34;channel_id&#34;: 1, &#34;escalation&#34;: false}],
  &#34;created_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;,
  &#34;updated_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;
}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-monitors-bulk">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/monitors/bulk</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Change settings on many monitors at once (ids, or every monitor matching a filter like the list&#39;s). Each setting is optional; it uses the monitor form&#39;s validation and one transaction. Settings that don&#39;t apply to a monitor&#39;s type are skipped and listed: agents_unsupported, timing_unsupported, timeout_exceeds_interval, escalation_needs_delay, agent_checked.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;filter&#34;: {&#34;type&#34;: &#34;http&#34;, &#34;tag&#34;: &#34;production&#34;}, &#34;set&#34;: {&#34;run_on_agents&#34;: true, &#34;confirm_with_agents&#34;: true, &#34;interval_seconds&#34;: 120, &#34;channels&#34;: {&#34;add&#34;: [{&#34;name&#34;: &#34;Ops Discord&#34;, &#34;escalation&#34;: false}], &#34;remove&#34;: [3]}, &#34;tags&#34;: {&#34;add&#34;: [{&#34;name&#34;: &#34;eu&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;teal&#34;, &#34;value&#34;: &#34;west&#34;}], &#34;remove&#34;: [&#34;legacy&#34;]}}}</code></pre>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
