            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="tags" aria-labelledby="tags-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="tags-title">Tags</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-tags">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/tags</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">List tags with how many monitors use them.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;data&#34;: [{&#34;id&#34;: 2, &#34;name&#34;: &#34;production&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;green&#34;, &#34;monitors&#34;: 12}], &#34;next_cursor&#34;: null}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-tags">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/tags</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Create a tag. Colours are palette names (red, orange, yellow, green, mint, teal, cyan, blue, indigo, purple, pink, brown, gray); hex values map to the nearest.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;name&#34;: &#34;production&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;green&#34;}</code></pre>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;id&#34;: 2, &#34;name&#34;: &#34;production&#34;, &#34;color&#34;: &#34;green&#34;}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-tags-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/tags/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Get one tag.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="patch--api-v1-tags-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">PATCH</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/tags/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Rename or recolour a tag.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;color&#34;: &#34;teal&#34;}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="delete--api-v1-tags-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">DELETE</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/tags/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Delete a tag (it is removed from every monitor).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="notifications" aria-labelledby="notifications-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="notifications-title">Notifications</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-notification-providers">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/notification-providers</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Every channel kind with its config fields (which are required, which are secret).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;data&#34;: [{&#34;kind&#34;: &#34;discord&#34;, &#34;label&#34;: &#34;Discord&#34;, &#34;fields&#34;: [{&#34;key&#34;: &#34;url&#34;, &#34;type&#34;: &#34;url&#34;, &#34;required&#34;: true, &#34;secret&#34;: true}]}]}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-notification-channels">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/notification-channels</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">List channels. Secrets are always masked as &#34;••••••&#34;.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
