        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-status-pages-id-subscribers">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/status-pages/{id}/subscribers</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">List the page&#39;s subscribers (email addresses or webhook URLs) with their confirmation state. A webhook with confirmed_at null waits for an editor&#39;s approval.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-status-pages-id-subscribers-sid-approve">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/status-pages/{id}/subscribers/{sid}/approve</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Approve a webhook sign-up. Webhooks are never confirmed by a link; once approved, the webhook gets a &#34;subscribed&#34; message with its unsubscribe link.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="delete--api-v1-status-pages-id-subscribers-sid">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">DELETE</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/status-pages/{id}/subscribers/{sid}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Remove a subscriber.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="maintenance" aria-labelledby="maintenance-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="maintenance-title">Maintenance</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-maintenance">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/maintenance</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">List maintenance windows with their current state.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-maintenance">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/maintenance</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Create a window. Times: start_at/end_at in UTC, time_from/time_to local to timezone, weekdays ISO (1 = Monday). Strategies: manual, once, daily, weekly, interval (interval_days, counted from start_at), monthly (month_days like 1,15,-1) and cron (cron + duration_minutes).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;title&#34;: &#34;Database upgrade&#34;, &#34;strategy&#34;: &#34;weekly&#34;, &#34;weekdays&#34;: &#34;2,4&#34;, &#34;time_from&#34;: &#34;<TIME>&#34;, &#34;time_to&#34;: &#34;<TIME>&#34;, &#34;timezone&#34;: &#34;Europe/Oslo&#34;, &#34;monitor_ids&#34;: [7]}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-maintenance-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/maintenance/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Get one window.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="patch--api-v1-maintenance-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">PATCH</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/maintenance/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Change a window; null clears a time field.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;active&#34;: false}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="delete--api-v1-maintenance-id">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">DELETE</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/maintenance/{id}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Delete a window.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="system-title">System</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-me">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/me</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Who you are and how you signed in.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;id&#34;: 1, &#34;username&#34;: &#34;ada&#34;, &#34;role&#34;: &#34;admin&#34;, &#34;auth&#34;: &#34;token&#34;, &#34;token_scope&#34;: &#34;read&#34;, &#34;can_edit&#34;: false, &#34;is_admin&#34;: false}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-health">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/health</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Version, uptime and monitor counts.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;status&#34;: &#34;ok&#34;, &#34;version&#34;: &#34;0.1.0&#34;, &#34;uptime_seconds&#34;: 86400, &#34;monitors&#34;: {&#34;total&#34;: 14, &#34;by_status&#34;: {&#34;up&#34;: 13, &#34;down&#34;: 1}}, &#34;status_pages&#34;: 1, &#34;agents&#34;: 2}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-agents">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/agents</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Remote probe agents and whether they&#39;re online.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-down">admin</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-settings">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/settings</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Instance settings.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-down">admin</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;retention_days&#34;: 90, &#34;base_url&#34;: &#34;https://status.example.com&#34;, &#34;timezone&#34;: &#34;Europe/Oslo&#34;, &#34;language&#34;: &#34;en&#34;, &#34;site_name&#34;: &#34;Vigilant Vole&#34;, &#34;badges_public&#34;: false, &#34;metrics_enabled&#34;: true}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="patch--api-v1-settings">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">PATCH</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/settings</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Change some settings.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-down">admin</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;retention_days&#34;: 180, &#34;base_url&#34;: &#34;https://status.example.com&#34;}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-openapijson">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/openapi.json</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">This reference as an OpenAPI 3.1 document.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-up">viewer</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="configuration" aria-labelledby="configuration-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="configuration-title">Configuration</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-v1-config">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/config</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Export the whole configuration as YAML or JSON. Secrets are masked unless an admin asks for them.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-pending">editor</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">المعاملات, أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <dl class="dl">
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>format</code></dt><dd>yaml (default) | json</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>secrets</code></dt><dd>1 to include secrets (admins only)</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>download</code></dt><dd>1 to download as a file</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>version: 1
tags:
  - name: production
    color: green
notification_channels:
  - name: Ops Discord
    kind: discord
    config:
      url: &#34;••••••&#34;
monitors:
  - name: Website
    monitor_type: http
    target: https://example.com
    interval_seconds: 30
    tags: [production]
    notifications: [Ops Discord]
status_pages:
  - slug: acme
    title: Acme status
    sections:
      - name: Services
        monitors: [Website]</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-v1-config">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/v1/config</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Import a configuration document (YAML or JSON body). Merge upserts by key; replace also deletes what the document doesn&#39;t list in the sections it contains. Masked secrets keep stored values.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-down">admin</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">المعاملات, أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <dl class="dl">
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>mode</code></dt><dd>merge (default) | replace</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>dry_run</code></dt><dd>1 to only return the plan</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>confirm</code></dt><dd>1, required to apply a replace</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>version: 1
tags:
  - name: production
    color: green
notification_channels:
  - name: Ops Discord
    kind: discord
    config:
      url: &#34;••••••&#34;
monitors:
  - name: Website
    monitor_type: http
    target: https://example.com
    interval_seconds: 30
    tags: [production]
    notifications: [Ops Discord]
status_pages:
  - slug: acme
    title: Acme status
    sections:
      - name: Services
        monitors: [Website]</code></pre>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{
  &#34;applied&#34;: false,
  &#34;mode&#34;: &#34;merge&#34;,
  &#34;summary&#34;: {&#34;create&#34;: 2, &#34;update&#34;: 1, &#34;delete&#34;: 0, &#34;unchanged&#34;: 14, &#34;skip&#34;: 0},
  &#34;items&#34;: [
    {&#34;kind&#34;: &#34;monitor&#34;, &#34;key&#34;: &#34;Website&#34;, &#34;action&#34;: &#34;update&#34;, &#34;changes&#34;: [&#34;interval_seconds&#34;]},
    {&#34;kind&#34;: &#34;tag&#34;, &#34;key&#34;: &#34;staging&#34;, &#34;action&#34;: &#34;create&#34;}
  ],
  &#34;errors&#34;: [],
  &#34;warnings&#34;: []
}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="push-and-machine-endpoints" aria-labelledby="push-and-machine-endpoints-title">
  <div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="push-and-machine-endpoints-title">Push and machine endpoints</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="toolbar"></div>
</div>
  <div class="card card-flush">
    <ul class="list" role="list">
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-push-token">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/push/{token}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Report a push monitor&#39;s status (POST works too). Rate limited to 1 per second.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">push token</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">المعاملات, أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <dl class="dl">
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>status</code></dt><dd>up (default) | down</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>msg</code></dt><dd>message to record</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>ping</code></dt><dd>response time in ms</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;ok&#34;: true}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-badge-id-kind">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/badge/{id}/{kind}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">SVG badge: kind is status, uptime, ping or cert-exp. Public when the monitor is on a published status page or badges are public.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">public</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">المعاملات</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <dl class="dl">
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>duration</code></dt><dd>24h | 7d | 30d</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>style</code></dt><dd>flat | flat-square</dd></div>
                <div class="dl-row"><dt><code>label</code></dt><dd>custom label</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-status-page-slug">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/status-page/{slug}</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">A published status page as JSON (CORS enabled), for embedding.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">public</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الاستجابة</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;title&#34;: &#34;Acme status&#34;, &#34;overall&#34;: {&#34;indicator&#34;: &#34;operational&#34;, &#34;title&#34;: &#34;All systems operational&#34;}, &#34;sections&#34;: [ … ], &#34;incidents&#34;: [ … ]}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--api-agent-v1-monitors">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/api/agent/v1/monitors</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">For remote agents: the monitors to run, the ones it checks for the server included (Bearer vva_… token, ETag).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">agent token</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--api-agent-v1-results">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/api/agent/v1/results</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">For remote agents: a batch of up to 500 results.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">agent token</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;results&#34;: [{&#34;monitor_id&#34;: 7, &#34;status&#34;: &#34;up&#34;, &#34;response_time_ms&#34;: 120, &#34;message&#34;: &#34;200 OK&#34;, &#34;checked_at&#34;: &#34;<DATETIME>&#34;}]}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--metrics">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/metrics</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Prometheus metrics (when enabled). Bearer token or basic-auth password; Kuma-compatible series included.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">metrics token</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="post--mcp">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">POST</span> <code class="break">/mcp</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Model Context Protocol server (Streamable HTTP, JSON-RPC 2.0) for AI assistants: tools to read and, with a write token, steer your monitors, incidents and maintenance, plus this reference as a resource. Bearer API token; GET answers 405. See docs/mcp.md.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">api token</span></span>
        <div class="list-full">
          <details class="disclosure">
            <summary>التفاصيل <span class="disclosure-sub">أمثلة</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></summary>
            <div class="disclosure-body stack-sm">
              <p class="t-footnote muted">الطلب</p>
              <pre class="code"><code>{&#34;jsonrpc&#34;: &#34;2.0&#34;, &#34;id&#34;: 1, &#34;method&#34;: &#34;tools/call&#34;, &#34;params&#34;: {&#34;name&#34;: &#34;why_is_it_down&#34;, &#34;arguments&#34;: {&#34;id&#34;: 7}}}</code></pre>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="list-row list-row-wrap" id="get--healthz">
        <span class="list-main">
          <span class="list-title"><span class="badge mono">GET</span> <code class="break">/healthz</code></span>
          <span class="list-sub">Liveness probe: always &#34;ok&#34;.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="list-trail"><span class="badge status-info">public</span></span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

  </main>

  <footer class="app-foot container">
